OL,3,GNEWSAShop keeps licence after rum found
OL,4,Ain jerry cans
OL,5,
OL,6,FHomemade rum punch cocktails sold as a
OL,7,F"slush puppy" were being produced on an
OL,8,F"industrial scale", according to police
OL,9,Finvestigating an off-licence.
OL,11,FManchester City Council heard officers
OL,12,Fseized jerry cans containing the drink
OL,13,Ffrom Richie and Nickie's Off Licence on
OL,14,FPrincess Road.
OL,16,FThe review centred on allegations
OL,17,Finvolving a rum punch known as Rum
OL,18,FBeats, suspected unpaid alcohol duty
OL,19,Fand Jamaican cigarettes found on the
OL,20,Fpremises.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
